content:
Help me define bounded contexts. Below I will provide domain information. 

#### Data:
These are the extracted objects and the subdomain grouping:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Trader",
      "description": "Person who buys and sells stocks to react to market movements"
    },
    {
      "name": "Stock",
      "description": "Tradable financial asset with a fluctuating price",
      "attributes": [
        "Price"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Price",
      "description": "Current market value of a stock"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sell",
      "description": "Action representing selling a stock"
    },
    {
      "name": "Buy",
      "description": "Action representing buying a stock"
    },
    {
      "name": "Trade Review",
      "description": "Evaluation of past buy and sell actions"
    },
    {
      "name": "Broker",
      "description": "Professional who executes client trades on the exchange"
    },
    {
      "name": "Trade Request",
      "description": "Instruction from a client to initiate a trade"
    },
    {
      "name": "Client",
      "description": "Person investing money and requesting trades",
      "attributes": [
        "Stock"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Trade Confirmation",
      "description": "Notification that a trade was executed"
    },
    {
      "name": "Portfolio Manager",
      "description": "Person managing investments and asset allocation"
    },
    {
      "name": "Market Trends",
      "description": "Insights about general stock market movements"
    },
    {
      "name": "Economic Report",
      "description": "Publication describing economic indicators"
    },
    {
      "name": "Market Analyst",
      "description": "Expert who studies companies and markets to provide insights"
    },
    {
      "name": "Stock Recommendation",
      "description": "Guidance suggesting buying or selling a stock"
    },
    {
      "name": "Industry News",
      "description": "Updates about company or sector developments"
    },
    {
      "name": "Performance Review",
      "description": "Assessment of how a client’s investments performed"
    }
  ]
}
```
```json
{
  "subdomains": {
    "Client Portfolio": {
      "objects": [
        "Client",
        "Portfolio Manager",
        "Stock",
        "Performance Review",
        "Market Trends",
        "Economic Report"
      ]
    },
    "Brokerage": {
      "objects": [
        "Broker",
        "Trade Request",
        "Trade Confirmation"
      ]
    },
    "Trading": {
      "objects": [
        "Trader",
        "Sell",
        "Buy",
        "Stock",
        "Trade Review",
        "Price"
      ]
    },
    "Market Analysis": {
      "objects": [
        "Market Analyst",
        "Stock Recommendation",
        "Industry News"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

#### Task:
- Assign the subdomains to bounded contexts. 
- Name the subdomain the bounded context might be derived from, it might also be multiple.
- In case an object appears in multiple bounded contexts, suggest a name change.
- Return the bounded contexts in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "... -> ..."
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

Here are the bounded contexts: 
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "Client Portfolio": {
      "derived from": "Client Portfolio Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Client",
        "Portfolio Manager",
        "Investment",
        "Performance Review",
        "Market Trends",
        "Economic Report"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Stock -> Investment"
      ]
    },
    "Brokerage": {
      "derived from": "Brokerage Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Broker",
        "Trade Request",
        "Trade Confirmation"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "Trading": {
      "derived from": "Trading Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Trader",
        "Sell",
        "Buy",
        "Stock",
        "Trade Review",
        "Price"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "Market Analysis": {
      "derived from": "Market Analysis Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Market Analyst",
        "Stock Recommendation",
        "Industry News"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    }
  }
}
```
